# Reactify local development environment
#
# Copy the API environment file and adjust values as needed:
#   cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
#
# Frontend optional overrides:
#   cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env
#
# Start PostgreSQL, then run all services with:
#   pnpm dev
#
# This starts:
# - API on http://localhost:3001
# - background worker
# - web on http://localhost:5174
#
# Database migrations:
#   pnpm db:migrate
#
# See apps/api/.env.example for all backend configuration including:
# - DATABASE_URL
# - AI_PROVIDER (mock | anthropic | openai)
# - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
# - OPENAI_API_KEY and stage-specific OpenAI models/token budgets
# - job queue settings
# - AI usage limits and pricing
